	"pokerstarz": ["Okay, that actually hurt. Smash that like button. Smash it better than you smashed me.", "Chat, he's cheating! Ban him! BAN HIM! Where are the mods?!", "Four hole cards. You have none. You have a mortgage.", "Don't forget to subscribe to my wins. Don't forget to unsubscribe from yours.", "This is content. You're content. You're basically a thumbnail.", "Rude. I'm demonetized. I'm DEMONETIZED.", "Oh my god, stop. Stop! I'm streaming!", "GG. No re. I'm clipping this. For the highlight reel of you losing.", "That's the clip of the day. Title: 'Idiot Dies.'"],
