	"steake": ["Nice hit. We're STILL going to the moon. The moon is a dumpster, but it's OUR dumpster.", "To the MOOOON! Or the floor! Whichever pays out!", "Worst hand wins, friend. Congrats on yours. It's a masterpiece of dogshit.", "Diamond hands! Diamond everything! Diamond-flavored ulcer!", "Not financial advice. But you're done. That is legal advice. From a clown.", "Buy the dip! Oh, that's me. That's me buying the dip. Painfully.", "Rug pull! Rug PULL! Somebody's pulling MY rug!", "HODL this, loser. HODL a feeling. A bad one. In a coffin.", "Liquidated. All of you. Every dollar. Every organ."],
	"bovadoh": ["...Impressive. Marginally. Like a cold bath. In a good way. I'm lying.", "Both hands. Now. At once. As expected. You'll fail at once.", "Two hands. Two defeats. Do the math. I have, and you're negative.", "You push, I take. It's called Pai Gow. It's called your problem.", "Dull. Everything's dull. You, too. Especially the dying.", "Hm. That stung. I shall feel it later. In a spa.", "Interesting. Do it again. I'll ignore it. Twice.", "Predictable. Like water. Like taxes. Like you, losing.", "As expected. I'll file this under 'Tuesday.'"],
	"seezers": ["You have wounded Caesar. Splendid. I shall stab you later. In the Senate.", "THIS IS THE END OF THE EMPIRE! AND THE START OF A BETTER BUFFET!", "Dealer stands. YOU do not. You will lie down. Like a Roman. Dead.", "I'd hit you on 16. And on 17. And on a Friday.", "Et tu, gambler? Et tu? Et DOUBLE-DOWN, brute!", "A mere scratch on the marble! Marble's expensive. I'm taking it out of your hide!", "By Jupiter! By Juno! By whoever I owe money to!", "Veni, vidi, bust. You came, you saw, you busted. I'll write it on a tablet. A tablet computer.", "Hail, Caesar. And farewell. Hail is complimentary. Farewell costs extra."],
	"wynners": ["A natural eight. Perhaps it's your turn. Perhaps it's mine. It's mine.", "Banker. Player. Tie. Doom. Doom always beats the other three.", "The shoe is cold. The room is colder. My heart is a fridge.", "Place your bets on the inevitable. The inevitable has a 1.06% house edge.", "Pinky out, darling. This will hurt. Mostly your pride. Also your ribs.", "How... rude. I shall tell my aunts.", "Mon Dieu. Mon Dieu, that's a lot of blood on the baize.", "The Circle closes. Again. It always closes. On you. With a click.", "Adieu. Un-adieu. Bonne chance in the next life. You'll need it."],
	"snake_eyes": ["Boxcars! BOXCARS! Twelve! You hate twelve! I love twelve!", "Natural! Natural! You hear that? That's my natural. It sings!", "Seven! You lose! Seven always loses! That's the rule I just invented!", "Snake eyes! Ssssnake EYES! You don't even want to know what's in my pocket!", "Come out roll! Come OUT! Come out, come out, wherever you suck!", "Hsss! Careful! Venom's expensive!", "Ow, ow, ow! My dice! My lucky dice! Why are you hitting them?!", "Sevennn! Sevennn! Your lucky number's dead!", "House pays. House always pays. Sometimes in teeth."],
	"rusty_slots": ["JACKPOT. JACKPOT. JACKPOT. Please insert your life savings.", "ERROR. ERROR. LUCKY SEVEN. ERROR. YOU ARE A SEVEN. ERROR.", "Insert coin to continue dying. No coin? Continue dying anyway.", "Spin. Spin. Spin. I'm not a machine. I'm an addiction with a handle.", "Pull my arm. Go on. I dare you. It's the only thing I've ever wanted.", "BZZZT. Ow. BZZZT. Is that my arm? Is that YOUR arm?", "Tilt. Tilt. Tilt. Someone call my mother. She's a toaster.", "Three bars. You lose. Three bars. You also lose. Three.", "OUT OF ORDER. OUT OF ORDER. HOPE: OUT OF ORDER."],
	"mr_lucky": ["My, my. You ARE lucky. Statistically unnerving. Please stop.", "Now, now. Pick a number. Any number. Wrong. I'm a little hurt.", "Pick eighty numbers. Hit none. I've done the math. Your odds are 'sorry.'", "Luck is just a lie told by the winning. I'm a very honest liar.", "Are you having fun? You will. Fun's a lottery. Of pain.", "Ow! Oh dear. I'm a very fragile gentleman.", "That was unkind. I shall mention it. To someone. I'm a ghost, but still.", "Never lucky. Always careful. Careful is just luck's older, scarier brother.", "Better luck next time. Always. That's the slogan. Print it on the casket."],
