## Extra scripted scenes (cutscene id -> lines [speaker, text]). Voice files live in
## voice/_cutscenes/<scene>/<scene>_<n>.ogg. The game plays the _arrive scenes when you
## reach a new city, the _clue scenes after the city's boss falls, and the rest at the
## secret-boss and final beats. One beat of THE STORY per city.
const SCENES := {
	"city1_arrive": [["RICO", "Atlantic Shitty. Salt, rust and slot machines. I love it already."], ["MARLOW", "Rico, you're in an alley. The casino's a block up. Start walking, and don't touch anything wet."], ["RICO", "Everything's wet, Marlow. That's the whole city."], ["RICO", "Hold on. That's a jacket. That's JULES'S jacket. Stained, ripped, still smells like him. Why is there a pawn ticket in the pocket?"], ["MARLOW", "A pawn ticket from Reno. Good news, Rico: Jules was here. Bad news: so was a dumpster fire."]],
	"city2_arrive": [["RICO", "Reno. The biggest little city. And that's a clown."], ["MARLOW", "That's the doorman. Smile. Don't get close."], ["VERA", "Welcome to the circus, sugar. Nobody leaves with their dignity."], ["HUSTLER", "Pawn ticket? Yeah, I remember your brother. Pawned his watch. Said he got 'promoted.' To Biloxi."], ["RICO", "Promoted to what? Biloxi's not a job. It's a rash."]],
	"city3_arrive": [["RICO", "Biloxi. Sharks in the lobby. Guitars on the wall. This is my kind of mistake."], ["MARLOW", "Hard Rok keeps the heavies near the stage. Stay quiet."], ["RICO", "Quiet's not really my instrument."], ["MARLOW", "Rico. Before you go in. I have to tell you something. I'm the one who got Jules his seat at The House's table."], ["RICO", "...You WHAT."], ["MARLOW", "I thought he'd win. He always won. It was a good bet. On paper. Terrible paper. Shredded paper. Flammable paper."], ["RICO", "I'm going to find you. After. I'm going to find you and I'm going to be so mad."], ["MARLOW", "Sure. Get mad. Get in line. But I'm the only one who knows the way up. Climb first. Yell second."]],
	"city4_arrive": [["RICO", "Fremont, Old Vegas. Neon older than my debt."], ["MARLOW", "Goldun Nugget's got a shark tank and a long memory. Everyone wants in. Nobody gets out."], ["MAGS", "I'll see you at the top, kid. With a calculator."], ["RICO", "...Wait. Handwriting. That's Jules. A note. 'Don't come for me. I'm finally winning.'"], ["RICO", "He doesn't want to be saved. He's hooked. Exactly like me. ...Okay, that's a little relatable."]],
	"city5_arrive": [["RICO", "The Strip. The nicest casino in the world. And I'm covered in alley."], ["SILAS", "Dear boy, the cloak room is that way. We shall do what we can."], ["THE HOUSE", "Welcome, Rico. We've been expecting you. For years. Your brother's been dealing since lunch."], ["MARLOW", "The penthouse is the top of the Bellagiro. That's where he is. Don't bet him."]],
	"city1_clue": [["RICO", "An IOU. Jules's handwriting. 'I owe the house one brother.' Okay, that's concerning."], ["MARLOW", "Look at the back. 'Reno.' He went to Reno. Good news, Jules is alive. Bad news, he's in Reno."]],
	"city2_clue": [["RICO", "Another IOU. 'Dealing at Hard Rok.' Dealing. For The House."], ["MARLOW", "Confirmed. Jules is dealing for The House now. Fast hands, no sleep. It's a very Jules career."]],
	"city3_clue": [["RICO", "An IOU, and a ripped receipt. 'Fremont. Goldun Nugget. Sublet: One lifetime.'"], ["MARLOW", "He's moving up. Every city, a better table. Every table, a worse deal."]],
	"city4_clue": [["RICO", "A chip with a name carved in it: 'JULES, PENTHOUSE.' Subtle."], ["MARLOW", "That's the top floor of the Bellagiro. One more climb. Don't die, Rico. I want to scream at you in person."]],
	"secret_found": [["RICO", "A hidden room? A secret table? The House is hiding something."], ["MARLOW", "That's not on the map, Rico. Be careful in there. By which I mean: be reckless. It's a secret table."]],
	"secret_defeat": [["RICO", "Another secret down. Another stack of chips."], ["MARLOW", "You're not supposed to know about those rooms. The House won't like it."], ["RICO", "Good."]],
	"final_prelude": [["THE HOUSE", "You climbed my five cities. You beat my table-lords. You wore my clothes."], ["RICO", "And I still got a bet on you."], ["THE HOUSE", "Then sit. Hole cards. Flop. Turn. River. And the pot, Rico, is your brother."]],
}
